- Added scripts/enterprise-capability-audit.js: cross-references
  WAR_ROOM_ROUTES against phases.json, flags broken paths, missing
  strategist/exec-portal chains, and industry verticals absent from
  war-room-prep.html's SECTOR_IDS tracker.
